### Create a new club (ADMIN only)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/clubs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer :token

{
  "name": "Club Los mas buenos 3",
  "foundedYear": 1935,
  "crestUrl": "https://imageio.forbes.com/i-forbesimg/media/lists/teams/barcelona_416x416.jpg?format=jpg",
  "description": "Club histórico de la ciudad",
  "createdBy": "user-admin-1"
}

### Create another club (ADMIN only)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/clubs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Real Madrid",
  "foundedYear": 1899,
  "description": "Hala Madrid",
  "createdBy": "user-admin-2"
}

### Get all clubs (ADMIN sees all, CLUB_MANAGER sees only their club)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clubs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search clubs by name (ADMIN only)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clubs?name=Municipal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get club by ID (ADMIN sees any, CLUB_MANAGER only their own)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clubs/REPLACE_WITH_CLUB_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update a club (replace with actual ID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/clubs/REPLACE_WITH_CLUB_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Club Deportivo Municipal - Renovado",
  "foundedYear": 1935,
  "crestUrl": "https://example.com/crest/municipal-new.png",
  "description": "Descripción actualizada"
}

### Soft delete (deactivate) a club (replace with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/clubs/REPLACE_WITH_CLUB_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
